  "summary_en": "NSW Government basic do/don't guidance for staff using public generative AI tools. It stresses fact-checking outputs, not entering sensitive or official information, avoiding AI decision-making for government, complying with copyright and law, enabling security controls, and consulting IT security teams.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Fact check and verify outputs before official use",
   "Do not allow generative AI to make decisions for the NSW Government",
   "Do not disclose or input personal, official, sensitive, classified or health information",
   "Do not use AI-generated code in government systems or ingest government datasets unless approved",
   "Follow entity internal policies and consult IT Security team or CISO if in doubt"
